0 19 537 [
[(The [route] object checks a message's first element against its arguments,)]
[(which may be numbers or symbols \050but not a mixture of the two\051. If a match)]
[(is found, the rest of the message appears on the corresponding outlet. If)]
[(there's no match, the message is repeated to the last "rejection" outlet.)]
[(The number of outlets is the number of arguments plus one.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
